# Build context for backend/Dockerfile. The image only needs the boot jar produced by
# `./gradlew bootJar`, so ignore everything and re-include that jar. This also keeps source,
# .env files and any local secrets out of the build context.
*
!build/libs/*.jar
# Gradle's classes-only jar is not runnable; exclude it so COPY matches the boot jar only.
build/libs/*-plain.jar
